# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: Telegram (Custom)
# Description: Telegram messaging network (IP ranges and domains)
# Note: APNs notifications are governed by system apsd; this rule handles app in-flight traffic.
#       Common domains (t.me, telegram.org) and ASNs are covered by upstream.
#       Custom retains verified additional IP ranges and keyword anchors.
# ==============================================================================

# Target: Core Telegram keyword match for unlisted client subdomains
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,telegram

# Telegram supplementary IP prefixes
# Evidence: Telegram core network edge routing tables, 2026-09-28
IP-CIDR,91.108.4.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,91.108.8.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,91.108.12.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,91.108.16.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,91.108.20.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,91.108.56.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:b28:f23d::/48,no-resolve
